        "TileImage": "$($repository 47424c02-bb0f-4066-af5a-f1cdcdcd08b2).Image",
        "Description": "This is based on a Freelancer mission I got. I added the falling lady because why not? Some Freelancer only targets were changed to nearby targets instead.\r\rIf you are having trouble suit only in the facility, try to remember the vent system on the yellow security floor.\r\rThere was a &apos;neckbreaker&apos; objective along with No Pacify. If you make 47 cling you a wall you can figure out a way to make this happen.\r\rSuggested item: Sieker or a thrown Emetic",
